    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6790" root="جى" body-key="j">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَايَاهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجَايَاةٌ</span>, <i>He faced him, fronted
him, was opposite to him,</i> or <i>was over against
him:</i> a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَايَأَهُ</span>. (IAar, K.) You say
also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَّ بِى مُجَايَاةً</span> <i>He passed by me being in
front,</i> or <i>opposite.</i> (TA.)

